@startuml
title End-to-End Recruitment, Hiring & Employee Onboarding Workflow

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #0f172a
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #f8fafc
skinparam ActivityFontColor #0f172a
skinparam ActivityFontSize 12
skinparam ActivityFontStyle bold

skinparam SwimlaneBorderColor #1d4ed8
skinparam SwimlaneWidth 230
skinparam SwimlaneTitleFontColor #1e3a8a
skinparam SwimlaneTitleFontSize 14
skinparam SwimlaneTitleFontStyle bold

skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5

|Department Manager|
start
:Draft Job Requisition & Define Headcount Needs;

|HR Manager|
:Review Job Budget & Requisition Justification;
if (Budget & Headcount Approved?) then (Approved)
  :Approve Job Requisition;
else (Rejected)
  :Reject Requisition with Feedback;
  stop
endif

|Recruiter|
:Create Public Job Posting & Set Application Deadline;
:Publish Job to Corporate Career Portal;

|Candidate|
:Browse Job Openings & Submit Application;
:Upload Resume CV (PDF/Docx) & Personal Info;

|Recruiter|
:Run Automatic CV Parser & Skill Match Engine;
:Filter Candidate Profiles by Qualification Score;
if (Meets Job Criteria?) then (Shortlisted)
  :Schedule Candidate Interview & Sync Calendar;
else (Disqualified)
  :Send Automated Regret Email;
  stop
endif

|Department Manager|
:Conduct Candidate Technical Interview;
:Complete Evaluation Scorecard & Rating Matrix;
:Submit Final Hiring Recommendation;

|HR Manager|
:Review Interview Scorecard & Salary Package;
:Approve Job Offer Terms & Contract Details;

|Recruiter|
:Generate Digital Job Offer Letter;
:Dispatch Job Offer to Candidate via Portal;

|Candidate|
if (Accept Offer?) then (Accepted)
  :Apply Digital Signature to Offer Letter;
  :Upload Pre-Hire Information & Background Scans;
else (Declined)
  :Decline Offer & State Reason;
  stop
endif

|HR Manager|
:Verify Submitted Background Documents;
:Generate Employee ID & Provision System Account;
:Trigger New-Hire Onboarding Task Checklist;
stop
@enduml
